INSERT INTO "documents" VALUES(1,'species','Common Mormon','Common Mormon (Papilio polytes) 中文名 玉带凤蝶 is a butterfly. Habitat: Gardens, parks and forest edges across Malaysia. 栖息地: 马来西亚的花园、公园和森林边缘。 Diet: Adults drink flower nectar; caterpillars eat the leaves of citrus plants. 食性: 成虫吸食花蜜；幼虫取食柑橘类植物的叶子。 Threats: Habitat loss and the use of pesticides in gardens. 威胁: 栖息地丧失和花园中农药的使用。 Conservation status: Not threatened. Fun fact: Some females copy the look of a poisonous butterfly to scare away predators. 趣闻: 部分雌蝶会模仿有毒蝴蝶的外貌，以吓退天敌。 Responsible observation: Watch it feed without touching its wings — they are delicate. 观察建议: 观察它进食时不要触碰翅膀——翅膀很脆弱。','','WildQuest curated content');
INSERT INTO "documents" VALUES(2,'species','Tailed Jay','Tailed Jay (Graphium agamemnon) 中文名 统帅青凤蝶 is a butterfly. Habitat: Gardens, orchards and lowland forests. 栖息地: 花园、果园和低地森林。 Diet: Adults drink nectar from flowers. 食性: 成虫吸食花蜜。 Threats: Habitat loss and pesticide use. 威胁: 栖息地丧失和农药使用。 Conservation status: Not threatened. Fun fact: It is one of the fastest-flying butterflies and is green with black spots. 趣闻: 它是飞行最快的蝴蝶之一，翅膀绿色带黑斑。 Responsible observation: Let it settle before you photograph it — no need to chase. 观察建议: 等它停稳再拍照——不必追逐。','','WildQuest curated content');
INSERT INTO "documents" VALUES(3,'species','Oriental Pied Hornbill','Oriental Pied Hornbill (Anthracoceros albirostris) 中文名 冠斑犀鸟 is a bird. Habitat: Lowland forests, forest edges and gardens. 栖息地: 低地森林、森林边缘和花园。 Diet: Fruit (especially figs), insects and small animals. 食性: 果实（尤其是无花果）、昆虫和小型动物。 Threats: Forest loss and the removal of old trees with nesting holes. 威胁: 森林丧失以及有筑巢洞的老树被砍伐。 Conservation status: Least Concern. Fun fact: The female seals herself inside a tree cavity to lay eggs, leaving a small gap for food. 趣闻: 雌鸟会把自己封在树洞里产卵，只留一个小口取食。 Responsible observation: Listen for its flapping call and watch from a distance. 观察建议: 听它拍翅的叫声，在远处观察。','','WildQuest curated content');
INSERT INTO "documents" VALUES(4,'species','Rhinoceros Hornbill','Rhinoceros Hornbill (Buceros rhinoceros) 中文名 马来犀鸟 is a bird. Habitat: Lowland and hill rainforest, especially old-growth forest. 栖息地: 低地和山地雨林，尤其是原始林。 Diet: Fruit (mainly figs), insects and small animals. 食性: 果实（主要是无花果）、昆虫和小型动物。 Threats: Forest loss and hunting for feathers and the casque. 威胁: 森林丧失以及为羽毛和盔突而进行的捕猎。 Conservation status: Vulnerable. Fun fact: It is the state bird of Sarawak and has a bright orange casque on its bill. 趣闻: 它是砂拉越州的州鸟，喙上有醒目的橙色盔突。 Responsible observation: Report sightings without sharing exact nest locations. 观察建议: 报告目击时不要公开确切的巢穴位置。','','WildQuest curated content');
INSERT INTO "documents" VALUES(5,'species','Asian Elephant','Asian Elephant (Elephas maximus) 中文名 亚洲象 is a mammal. Habitat: Lowland and hill forest across Peninsular Malaysia and Borneo. 栖息地: 马来西亚半岛和婆罗洲的低地与山地森林。 Diet: Grasses, leaves, bark and fruit. 食性: 草、树叶、树皮和果实。 Threats: Habitat loss and conflict with farms and plantations. 威胁: 栖息地丧失以及与农田和种植园的冲突。 Conservation status: Endangered. Fun fact: They use their trunk to smell, drink, greet and pick up food. 趣闻: 它们用象鼻来闻、喝水、打招呼和取食。 Responsible observation: Keep far away and never block their path — they are wild animals. 观察建议: 保持很远距离，绝不挡住它的去路——它们是野生动物。','','GBIF');
INSERT INTO "documents" VALUES(6,'species','Malayan Tiger','Malayan Tiger (Panthera tigris jacksoni) 中文名 马来亚虎 is a mammal. Habitat: Tropical forest, mainly in the central forest spine. 栖息地: 热带森林，主要分布在中部森林脊柱。 Diet: Deer, wild boar and other medium-sized animals. 食性: 鹿、野猪和其他中型动物。 Threats: Poaching, habitat loss and decline of prey. 威胁: 盗猎、栖息地丧失和猎物减少。 Conservation status: Critically Endangered. Fun fact: Each tiger has a unique stripe pattern, like a fingerprint. 趣闻: 每只老虎的条纹都是独一无二的，就像指纹。 Responsible observation: Tigers are rare and shy — never try to find or approach one. 观察建议: 老虎稀有而害羞——千万不要去寻找或靠近。','','GBIF');
INSERT INTO "documents" VALUES(7,'species','Malayan Tapir','Malayan Tapir (Tapirus indicus) 中文名 马来貘 is a mammal. Habitat: Rainforest, often near water. 栖息地: 雨林，常靠近水源。 Diet: Leaves, shoots and fruit. 食性: 树叶、嫩枝和果实。 Threats: Habitat loss and road accidents. 威胁: 栖息地丧失和交通事故。 Conservation status: Endangered. Fun fact: Babies are born with stripes and spots that fade as they grow. 趣闻: 幼崽出生时带条纹和斑点，长大后逐渐褪去。 Responsible observation: If you see one, keep your distance and move quietly away. 观察建议: 如果看到它，保持距离并安静离开。','','GBIF');
INSERT INTO "documents" VALUES(8,'species','Malayan Sun Bear','Malayan Sun Bear (Helarctos malayanus) 中文名 马来熊 is a mammal. Habitat: Tropical forest, spending much time in trees. 栖息地: 热带森林，大部分时间待在树上。 Diet: Insects, honey, fruit and small animals. 食性: 昆虫、蜂蜜、果实和小型动物。 Threats: Habitat loss and the illegal pet trade. 威胁: 栖息地丧失和非法宠物贸易。 Conservation status: Vulnerable. Fun fact: It is the world''s smallest bear and has a pale horseshoe mark on its chest. 趣闻: 它是世界上最小的熊，胸前有淡色马蹄形斑纹。 Responsible observation: Never feed a sun bear — it can become dependent and dangerous. 观察建议: 绝不要投喂马来熊——它会变得依赖且危险。','','GBIF');
INSERT INTO "documents" VALUES(9,'species','Proboscis Monkey','Proboscis Monkey (Nasalis larvatus) 中文名 长鼻猴 is a mammal. Habitat: Mangroves and riverine forest of Borneo. 栖息地: 婆罗洲的红树林和河岸森林。 Diet: Leaves, seeds and unripe fruit. 食性: 树叶、种子和未成熟果实。 Threats: Habitat loss along rivers and mangroves. 威胁: 沿河和红树林的栖息地丧失。 Conservation status: Endangered. Fun fact: The male''s large nose is thought to make its calls louder. 趣闻: 雄猴的大鼻子被认为能让叫声更响亮。 Responsible observation: Watch quietly from a boat or trail without disturbing the troop. 观察建议: 在船上或小径上安静观察，不要惊扰猴群。','','WildQuest curated content');
INSERT INTO "documents" VALUES(10,'species','Lesser Mouse-deer','Lesser Mouse-deer (Tragulus kanchil) 中文名 小鼷鹿 is a mammal. Habitat: Dense forest undergrowth. 栖息地: 茂密的森林下层。 Diet: Leaves, fruit and fungi. 食性: 树叶、果实和真菌。 Threats: Habitat loss and hunting. 威胁: 栖息地丧失和捕猎。 Conservation status: Least Concern. Fun fact: It is one of the smallest hoofed animals in the world. 趣闻: 它是世界上最小的有蹄动物之一。 Responsible observation: It is shy and mostly active at night — a rare, lucky sighting. 观察建议: 它害羞且多在夜间活动——能见到是很幸运的。','','GBIF');
INSERT INTO "documents" VALUES(11,'species','Sunda Colugo','Sunda Colugo (Galeopterus variegatus) 中文名 巽他鼯猴 is a mammal. Habitat: Rainforest canopy, including gardens near forest. 栖息地: 雨林树冠，包括森林附近的花园。 Diet: Leaves, flowers and fruit. 食性: 树叶、花和果实。 Threats: Forest loss. 威胁: 森林丧失。 Conservation status: Least Concern. Fun fact: It glides between trees using a skin membrane — it does not truly fly. 趣闻: 它用皮膜在树间滑翔——并不是真正飞行。 Responsible observation: Look up quietly at dusk when colugos become active. 观察建议: 黄昏时分安静地抬头观察，那时鼯猴开始活跃。','','WildQuest curated content');
INSERT INTO "documents" VALUES(12,'species','Malayan Pangolin','Malayan Pangolin (Manis javanica) 中文名 马来穿山甲 is a mammal. Habitat: Forest and sometimes plantations. 栖息地: 森林，有时也在种植园。 Diet: Ants and termites. 食性: 蚂蚁和白蚁。 Threats: Illegal wildlife trade — it is the world''s most trafficked mammal. 威胁: 非法野生动物贸易——它是世界上被贩运最多的哺乳动物。 Conservation status: Critically Endangered. Fun fact: Its scales are made of keratin, the same material as your fingernails. 趣闻: 它的鳞片由角蛋白构成，和你的指甲是同样的材料。 Responsible observation: Never reveal where you saw a pangolin — this protects it from poachers. 观察建议: 绝不要透露穿山甲的位置——这能保护它免受盗猎。','','GBIF');
INSERT INTO "documents" VALUES(13,'species','Green Sea Turtle','Green Sea Turtle (Chelonia mydas) 中文名 绿海龟 is a reptile. Habitat: Coastal waters, seagrass beds and nesting beaches. 栖息地: 沿海水域、海草床和产卵海滩。 Diet: Seagrass and algae. 食性: 海草和藻类。 Threats: Habitat loss, plastic pollution and poaching of eggs. 威胁: 栖息地丧失、塑料污染和盗取龟蛋。 Conservation status: Endangered. Fun fact: Females return to the same beach where they hatched to lay their own eggs. 趣闻: 雌龟会回到自己出生的海滩产卵。 Responsible observation: Watch nesting turtles only with a guide and never use bright lights. 观察建议: 只在向导带领下观察产卵海龟，绝不用强光。','','WildQuest curated content');
INSERT INTO "documents" VALUES(14,'species','Reticulated Python','Reticulated Python (Malayopython reticulatus) 中文名 网纹蟒 is a reptile. Habitat: Forest, often near rivers and water. 栖息地: 森林，常靠近河流和水域。 Diet: Mammals and birds. 食性: 哺乳动物和鸟类。 Threats: Hunting for skin and the pet trade. 威胁: 为获取蛇皮和宠物贸易而进行的捕猎。 Conservation status: Least Concern (protected in Malaysia). Fun fact: It is one of the longest snakes in the world. 趣闻: 它是世界上最长的蛇之一。 Responsible observation: Admire from a safe distance — never pick up or provoke a snake. 观察建议: 在安全距离外欣赏——绝不捡起或挑逗蛇。','','WildQuest curated content');
INSERT INTO "documents" VALUES(15,'species','Saltwater Crocodile','Saltwater Crocodile (Crocodylus porosus) 中文名 湾鳄 is a reptile. Habitat: Rivers, estuaries and mangroves. 栖息地: 河流、河口和红树林。 Diet: Fish, crustaceans and mammals. 食性: 鱼、甲壳类和哺乳动物。 Threats: Habitat loss and historical hunting. 威胁: 栖息地丧失和历史上的捕猎。 Conservation status: Least Concern. Fun fact: It is the largest living reptile. 趣闻: 它是现存最大的爬行动物。 Responsible observation: Stay away from river edges in crocodile areas and follow local signs. 观察建议: 在鳄鱼出没区远离河边并遵守当地标志。','','WildQuest curated content');
