INSERT INTO "documents" VALUES(156,'location','Bukit Gasing Forest Reserve','Bukit Gasing Forest Reserve is a Forest reserve in Malaysia. A small, family-friendly green lung with forest trails close to the city. Why recommended: Nearby, with gentle trails and regular butterfly and bird sightings.. Facilities: Trails, Parking, Rest area. Suggested visit time: 7:00–10:00 AM.','','WildQuest curated');
INSERT INTO "documents" VALUES(157,'location','FRIM (Forest Research Institute Malaysia)','FRIM (Forest Research Institute Malaysia) is a Forest reserve in Malaysia. A research forest with a canopy walkway and rich biodiversity. Why recommended: Easy access to a real rainforest canopy and frequent wildlife observation reports.. Facilities: Canopy walkway, Trails, Parking, Restroom. Suggested visit time: 8:00–11:00 AM.','','WildQuest curated');
INSERT INTO "documents" VALUES(158,'location','Taman Negara National Park','Taman Negara National Park is a National park in Malaysia. One of the world''s oldest rainforests, home to elephants, tapirs and hornbills. Why recommended: For families wanting a deeper rainforest experience with guided support.. Facilities: Guided trails, River trips, Accommodation. Suggested visit time: March–September.','','WildQuest curated');
INSERT INTO "documents" VALUES(159,'location','Kuala Selangor Nature Park','Kuala Selangor Nature Park is a Nature park in Malaysia. Mangrove forest with resident and migratory birds and fireflies at night. Why recommended: A safe boardwalk for watching wetland birds and reptiles.. Facilities: Mangrove boardwalk, Bird hides, Parking. Suggested visit time: 5:00–9:00 PM (fireflies).','','WildQuest curated');
INSERT INTO "documents" VALUES(160,'location','Bako National Park','Bako National Park is a National park in Malaysia. Sarawak''s oldest park, famous for proboscis monkeys and diverse habitats. Why recommended: One of the best places to see proboscis monkeys in the wild.. Facilities: Trails, Boat transfer, Lodging. Suggested visit time: April–October.','','WildQuest curated');
INSERT INTO "documents" VALUES(161,'location','Cherating Turtle Sanctuary','Cherating Turtle Sanctuary is a Sanctuary in Malaysia. A beach sanctuary protecting nesting green sea turtles. Why recommended: A supervised way to learn about sea-turtle conservation.. Facilities: Visitor centre, Guided night watch, Parking. Suggested visit time: July–October (nesting season).','','WildQuest curated');
INSERT INTO "documents" VALUES(162,'location','Paya Indah Wetlands','Paya Indah Wetlands is a Wetland reserve in Malaysia. An official PERHILITAN eco-tourism wetland reserve rich in birdlife. Why recommended: Boardwalks and hides make it easy to watch wetland birds safely.. Facilities: Wetland trails, Visitor centre, Parking. Suggested visit time: 8:00–11:00 AM.','','PERHILITAN official eco-tourism list');
INSERT INTO "documents" VALUES(163,'location','Taman Negara Kelantan, Kuala Koh','Taman Negara Kelantan, Kuala Koh is a National park in Malaysia. A quieter gateway into the Taman Negara rainforest in Kelantan. Why recommended: Less crowded rainforest access with guided river and forest trails.. Facilities: Guided trails, River. Suggested visit time: March–September.','','PERHILITAN official eco-tourism list');
INSERT INTO "documents" VALUES(164,'location','Taman Negara Pulau Pinang','Taman Negara Pulau Pinang is a National park in Malaysia. One of the world''s smallest national parks, where forest meets the coast. Why recommended: Coastal trails and accessible rainforest in a compact park.. Facilities: Trails, Beach. Suggested visit time: March–October.','','PERHILITAN official eco-tourism list');
INSERT INTO "documents" VALUES(165,'location','Taman Negara Pahang, Sg Relau, Merapoh','Taman Negara Pahang, Sg Relau, Merapoh is a National park in Malaysia. Western gateway to Taman Negara Pahang, known for caves and forest trails. Why recommended: Quiet trails and limestone caves with family-friendly routes.. Facilities: Trails, Caves. Suggested visit time: March–September.','','PERHILITAN official eco-tourism list');
INSERT INTO "documents" VALUES(166,'location','Taman Negara Terengganu, Tanjung Mentong','Taman Negara Terengganu, Tanjung Mentong is a National park in Malaysia. Eastern entrance to Taman Negara along Lake Kenyir. Why recommended: Boat access across Lake Kenyir to the rainforest.. Facilities: River trips, Trails. Suggested visit time: March–September.','','PERHILITAN official eco-tourism list');
INSERT INTO "documents" VALUES(167,'location','Kuala Gandah Elephant Conservation Centre','Kuala Gandah Elephant Conservation Centre is a Conservation centre in Malaysia. PERHILITAN''s national Asian elephant conservation centre. Why recommended: A supervised way to learn about Asian elephant conservation.. Facilities: Visitor centre, Guided talks. Suggested visit time: Open daily; morning sessions.','','PERHILITAN official eco-tourism list');
INSERT INTO "documents" VALUES(168,'location','Taman Negara Pahang, Kuala Tahan','Taman Negara Pahang, Kuala Tahan is a National park in Malaysia. The main gateway to Taman Negara, home to the famous canopy walkway. Why recommended: The classic family rainforest experience with a canopy walkway.. Facilities: Canopy walkway, Guided trails, River trips, Accommodation. Suggested visit time: March–September.','','PERHILITAN official eco-tourism list');
INSERT INTO "documents" VALUES(169,'location','Tapak RAMSAR Tasek Bera','Tapak RAMSAR Tasek Bera is a RAMSAR wetland in Malaysia. Malaysia''s first RAMSAR wetland, a protected freshwater lake system. Why recommended: Guided boat trips through a protected freshwater wetland.. Facilities: Boat trips, Visitor centre. Suggested visit time: Dry season (March–September).','','PERHILITAN official eco-tourism list');
